{"id":"8-15","altIds":[],"chapter":8,"name":"AWorld-train 配套说明","title":"AWorld-train——在沙盒中学习使用工具","type":"repro","typeLabel":"复现","stars":3,"summary":"bojieli/AWorld 中的 GAIA MCP 沙盒与训练入口，bojieli/verl 为训练后端","path":"chapter8/AWorld-train","external":false,"status":"AWorld and veRL checkouts match the pinned SHAs and exact entrypoints are mapped. Historical upstream logs in the checko","statusNote":"**External reproduction; not run**","readme":[{"kind":"heading","depth":2,"text":"把多步 Agent 环境接入训练","id":"rh-1"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"搜索、读取资料和调用工具组成的长任务，需要把环境状态与模型采样连接起来。本项目以 AWorld 和训练后端为例，学习一个 Agent 任务怎样成为可训练的交互过程。"}]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"建议按以下顺序阅读："},{"t":"a","href":"#learning-0","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"理解问题与方法"}]},{"t":"text","v":" → "},{"t":"a","href":"#learning-1","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"准备环境与输入"}]},{"t":"text","v":" → "},{"t":"a","href":"#learning-2","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"按照步骤完成实验"}]},{"t":"text","v":" → "},{"t":"a","href":"#learning-3","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"分析结果与形成判断"}]},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":3,"text":"理解问题与方法","id":"rh-2"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"环境负责动作执行与观察，采样流程收集轨迹，奖励评价任务结果，训练后端更新模型。组件之间的状态与消息契约必须一致，否则训练可能优化与实际任务无关的信号。"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"AWorld Train","id":"rh-3"},{"kind":"hr"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"目录","id":"rh-4"},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#简介","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"简介"}]}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#关于本教育性实验的重要说明","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"关于本教育性实验的重要说明"}]}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#核心特性","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"核心特性"}]}]}]]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#gaia-环境工具生态","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"GAIA 环境工具生态"}]}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"#-web-交互工具3-服务器9-工具","ext":false,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Web 交互工具"}]}]}],[{"kind":"